        "color_title": "#1c1d1b",
        "fontsize_title": 48,
        "fontsize_title_mb": 35,
        "brand_des": "<p>This brand stands for the celebration of life in Miami: the city light, the arts & culture, the nightlife, the diversity, the food, the shopping, the business life, and the joyful and uplifting spirit… Each of us has reasons to enjoy the life of the city and all of them are encapsulated in the <strong class=\"Nobrk\">I AM MIAMI</strong> brand.  \n</p><p><strong>A brand that is a badge of Miami pride.</strong>\n</p><p>Let’s celebrate and be proud of this city because life is too short not to be in Miami!</p>\n<a href=\"/pages/who-am-i\" class=\"text_link\">More</a>",
